# RootForge OS — AI/LLM tooling package list
# Victorious Framework | Origin Source Labs
#
# Packages baked into the squashfs at build time (README section 15).
# Node.js comes from the NodeSource LTS repo (hook: 0010-nodesource.hook.chroot)
# not Debian's older packaged version — Claude Code requires a current Node.
# Ollama binary is installed via its own hook (0020-ollama.hook.chroot).
# Claude Code CLI is installed via npm hook (0030-claude-code.hook.chroot).
#
# API keys and model weight pulls are NOT here — see scripts/setup_ai_tools.sh.

# npm is pulled in as a NodeSource dependency; listed for clarity
npm
